activation	Substitute placeholders	2026-10-27T11:15:40.4313702Z   GH_AW_STEPS_PREPARE_OUTPUTS_ISSUE: {"title": "v2.0.0-dev84858: Vector::Reference used on vector of different type (source INTEGER[] referenced INTEGER)", "body": "### What happens?\n\nWe see this internal error with latest v2.0-cyanoptera. I didn't see a similar report.\n\n### To Reproduce\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE t1 (c1 INTEGER, c2 INTEGER[]);\nINSERT INTO t1 VALUES (1, NULL), (2, NULL);\n\nUPDATE t1 SET c2 = s3.a1\nFROM (\n    SELECT t1.c1                   AS a0,\n           max(s1.v1)              AS a1,\n           max(t1.c1)::BIGINT      AS a2,\n           count(DISTINCT t1.c1)   AS a3\n    FROM t1\n    JOIN (SELECT c1 AS k1, [c1] AS v1 FROM t1) AS s1 ON (t1.c1 = s1.k1)\n    JOIN (SELECT DISTINCT c1 FROM t1)          AS s2 ON (t1.c1 = s2.c1)\n    GROUP BY t1.c1\n) AS s3\nWHERE t1.c1 = s3.a0;\n\n```\n\n```\nINTERNAL Error:\nVector::Reference used on vector of different type (source INTEGER[] referenced INTEGER)\n\nStack Trace:\n\n0        duckdb::Exception::ToJSON(duckdb::ExceptionType, std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>> const&) + 420\n1        duckdb::Exception::Exception(duckdb::ExceptionType, std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>> const&) + 468\n2        duckdb::InternalException::InternalException(std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>> const&) + 220\n3        duckdb::InternalException::InternalException(std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>> const&) + 84\n4        duckdb::InternalException::InternalException<duckdb::LogicalType const&, duckdb::LogicalType const&>(std::__1::basic_string<char, std::__1::char_traits<char>, std::__1::allocator<char>> const&, duckdb::LogicalType const&, duckdb::LogicalType const&) + 580\n5        duckdb::Vector::Reference(duckdb::Vector const&) + 852\n6        duckdb::ExpressionEx